cks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a82281d4-50cc-45a4-87ea-36bc9a0ad981","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"なんかこう面倒くさい事になると自分ならさっさと旧OSはサポート対象外にしてしまいそう。","ts":"1629390408.404300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o/f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"586F673C-C85D-4774-812F-0E5F1ABF273D","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"MZでは改良された","ts":"1629390389.403900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c/3O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6EC78B23-7353-4268-A130-444FBCF1A871","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"pixiと謎の超密結合しててpixiのバージョン上げられない問題","ts":"1629390356.403300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RlHNd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A67D6E33-A00B-4C69-99C8-0BEE82CB4FF2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あーなるほどそういうことか","ts":"1629390328.402400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qCPt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0abcf74-8dfd-4726-a374-ec50a796df93","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; しかしながら、ツクールMVをmacOSの最新バージョンと互換性を持たせるための改良には膨大な作業時間がかかるだけでなく、これによってネット上にあるユーザー作プラグインの大部分が壊れてしまう可能性が指摘されました。\nこれがよくわからなかったけど、多分 Pixi.js のメジャーバージョン上げざるを得ないって話かなあ","ts":"1629389317.402000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SulE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8769918-c1fa-46ac-a9b1-0b4b8b19b3ee","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"OpenGL は一応まだ使える","ts":"1629389282.401500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cYt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c88708a-08a3-4e06-8fb0-e6be6a007e54","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; Apple社によるOpenGlのサポートの廃止、さらに32ビットソフトウェアのサポートを削除するなどの変更に伴い、RPGツクールMVは最新のmacOSアップデートで多くの互換性問題を抱えてきました。\nnw.js 使ってたと思うけど、とおもったが、これはエディタの話かな","ts":"1629389253.401200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FH5g+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"819fcc94-c78d-45ae-82b8-0918aa8a980e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://rpgtkool.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/08/19/120004\u003e macOS","ts":"1629389214.400400","attachments":[{"fallback":"RPGツクール公式ブログ: RPGツクールMV macOS対応に関しまして - RPGツクール公式ブログ","id":1,"title":"RPGツクールMV macOS対応に関しまして - RPGツクール公式ブログ","title_link":"https://rpgtkool.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/08/19/120004","text":"RPGツクールMVユーザーの皆様へ。 『RPGツクールMV』macOS BigSur 11.0以降の対応についてのお知らせです。 Apple社によるOpenGlのサポートの廃止、さらに32ビットソフトウェアのサポートを削除するなどの変更に伴い、RPGツクールMVは最新のmacOSアップデートで多くの互換性問題を抱えてきました。 すでにご承知のこととは存じますが、これらApple社のサポート廃止/削除は小さな変更ではないため、RPGツクールMV開発部はMVを最新のmacOSバージョンへ対応させるための検討を重ねてきました。 しかしながら、ツクールMVをmacOSの最新バージョンと互換性を持たせる…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/6653586347148893594/26006613798586720/1629342626","blocks":null,"ts":1629342004,"service_name":"RPGツクール公式ブログ","service_icon":"https://rpgtkool.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://rpgtkool.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/08/19/120004","original_url":"https://rpgtkool.hatenablog.com/entry/2021/08/19/120004"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OquXd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30998c83-0a52-43b1-b851-8a1a7fa4ff3b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Android は 5 がいまだに無視できない割合で使われてたりするんですよ…","ts":"1629389072.399700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jJG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f7ffd39-6cd8-463f-8e8b-b403c7b0693d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Androidと同じくサポートEOLしたものは除外するという方針にした方が良いのでは？","ts":"1629389048.399300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PNV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2a824ce-4137-4410-a62c-e65c325362f2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"悩ましいですね。自分の場合はそんな SDK に依存したものはないので、とにかく古いので良いんですが。 (Go の場合 minimum が 10.13 とかかな)","ts":"1629387110.398600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kMI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8063fdf7-dcef-4776-9e7b-9ee7872c9915","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"iOS と違って化石のような macOS は普通に使われてる…","ts":"1629386705.397800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iP4Rz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf368160-5641-4dc0-8b31-f1a6b4cafcbd","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"SDKの機能がかわるからなあ。macOSどこまで古いバージョンサポートするかは悩ましい。","ts":"1629386643.396900","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1629386661.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LrX3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32157861-51d6-48b2-afda-8459faecd46a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あとハマったポイントは、 Go の場合 `CGO_CFLAGS=-mmacosx-version-min=10.12 CGO_LDFLAGS=-mmacosx-version-min=10.12` しておかないと古いマシンで起動できないバイナリが出来上がってしまう","ts":"1629386574.396400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B=8g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f3488a6-4366-462c-8915-3f4d44a91da2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"はい、 ditto で解決しました","ts":"1629386533.395300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pQJz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cd1a1ae-631a-4b37-b8ef-40e927d8b6f6","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"posix 向けの場合。macOS 向けの macOS の何かであれば ditto とかそれ専用のツールがあるのでそっち使うかな。イメージなら asr とか、hdiutil とか…","ts":"1629386476.394400","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1629386495.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X1z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e083618-ef15-4273-978f-31ec581d5bf3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"今回のケースは ._ がちゃんとコピーされてほしいのにされなかったという問題なので逆ですね","ts":"1629386446.393700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGJG6S9JM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cdq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0100eaaa-4737-4dd7-bb9a-2ae5dfe555c1","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"そうです、どのツールがどこかで/usr/binのzipやtarを使うかわかんないですからね。","ts":"1629386384.392000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AWJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66cc51c5-5a4a-4316-9d73-5690fd8b2fb7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"リソースフォークをコピーさせないためですか?","ts":"1629386360.391400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hgi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a4172a3-0dfa-469b-a893-20f1c0e5e025","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"なので、配布系ビルドの `Makefile` では、`export COPYFILE_DISABLE = 1` とかしておくのです","ts":"1629386339.391100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iYyK9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6eec0366-def4-4d65-8809-afd5a94adcf6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"へぇへぇ","ts":"1629386318.390600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5lckH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c717e708-da89-41b6-852f-5b509714b41b","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"あまり知られていないんですが、macOS で Apple の zip や tar を使うときはこれを立てるってると resource folk の `._` なんとかが作られないんですよね。","ts":"1629386245.389800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sb0OW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e4b91f4-cc58-486c-940e-d74ea291e1bd","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"`COPYFILE_DISABLE` という環境変数があってですね…","ts":"1629386183.388600","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1629386188.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fFDZ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17c7e1be-52d0-44d7-81cd-fac51d3f4ea7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"terminal 上だと現れないけど ditto コマンドで zip で固めると出てくる謎のファイル","ts":"1629385258.388300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KxAJd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cb6aa66-ac17-4acb-aecf-4ff83434cf74","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"._foo みたいなファイルがあったりなかったりします","ts":"1629385239.387900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3X/2D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afa403fd-3019-4f18-8db8-4986c9a5bf52","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それじゃないです (それはあってもなくても無害)","ts":"1629385214.387400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5uU"}]}]
